{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "d2c1ce84bd7dc5c68808c2c708076251e3a62b6a65de4b780869cd664e7860fa", "ja": "おおいに笑う乙女たち", "zh": "开怀欢笑的少女们", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "829248e4ccf1ee43f0a7849be4f7f573a36f0abdcf625fa9df5c6c99a5403e3c", "ja": "昼休み、待ち合わせをしている海美と育。\nあずさを待たせているからと急かしつつ、\n不慣れながらも姉として育を引っ張る。\n久しぶりにそろった3人の姉妹は、\n今しかないひとときを謳歌するのだった。", "zh": "午休时间，海美与育相约碰面。\n因为让梓久等了，海美催促着育，\n虽然还不太习惯，却努力以姐姐的身份带着她前行。\n久违地聚在一起的3姐妹，\n尽情享受着这段只属于此刻的时光。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_07_1000_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_07_1001_030iku", "source_sha256": "c654235af76141a536230bf049206dc6a0d49643a237c8510984852b8632a2d5", "ja": "海美さん！\nお待たせしちゃって、ごめんなさい。", "zh": "海美姐！\n让你久等了，对不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_07_1002_029umi", "source_sha256": "6c6fc28465fbacbd0c3c9bc71547252a6970018ae570e64cb58453f6f148a3b0", "ja": "まったく……遅いわよ！　もうあずさお姉さまは\nお待ちになっているんですからね！", "zh": "真是的……太慢啦！梓姐姐大人\n可都已经在等了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_07_1003_030iku", "source_sha256": "83383f64ce36ab96d5df3b76d815948fac28e14e03ee68ec74e7a1c6dbf76cc6", "ja": "うん、急がなくっちゃ！　せっかく久しぶりに、\n3人でお昼が食べられるんだもんね♪", "zh": "嗯，得快点了！难得久违地\n可以3个人一起吃午饭呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_07_1004_029umi", "source_sha256": "291ccaf071c331ae8c6dd5f835def89e56f74200aad5f25e367c7082b6d41247", "ja": "わかっているなら、よろしくてよ。\nそれから……。", "zh": "明白的话，那就好办了。\n还有就是……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_07_1005_030iku", "source_sha256": "f0fa6297c28336e24d72473acf329697716b2c7bb485f4f4e59153b9aae0d318", "ja": "？\n海美さん、どうかしたの？", "zh": "？海美小姐，你怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_07_1006_029umi", "source_sha256": "c5948f59ffffd9efc61ae4c620e397ab6acae3317215d7bdcba0382fb431ad22", "ja": "な、なんでもないわ！\n早くしないと、置いていくわよ！", "zh": "没、没什么！\n再不快点，我就要把你甩在后面了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_07_2000_030iku", "source_sha256": "8f446e5b07f236cd84319d6e24c3344589e5966fcecede82672f60a9468a7426", "ja": "それでね！　海美さんにバトンが渡ったら、一気に\n他の人を抜いて1位をとっちゃったの。すごいよね♪", "zh": "然后啊！一棒传给海美姐姐之后，她一口气\n超过了其他人拿到第1名呢。好厉害对吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_07_2001_029umi", "source_sha256": "8b356d966e65d2b57c4c154b63a086938250f68e355c8ae55c95a63e5e9fd67d", "ja": "べ、別に……あんなの、たいしたことじゃないわ。\nそれより育、あなた授業中によそ見をしていたの？", "zh": "没、没什么啦……那种程度，根本不算什么啦。\n比起这个，育，你上课的时候东张西望了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_07_2002_030iku", "source_sha256": "ae7ffd297bc6931fbc7e8b5a217e4d5dea6771c623a40ad014d941374ab5441a", "ja": "だって、すごくカッコよかったし……海美さんの活躍、\nあずさお姉ちゃんにも聞いてもらわなくちゃって！", "zh": "因为真的很帅嘛……而且海美姐姐那么活跃的表现，\n我也一定要讲给梓姐姐听才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_07_2003_010azu", "source_sha256": "ba3babaab849529433f7a5651abd8c22f8ef40e98691abe9ed2610dbaa33573b", "ja": "ふふ……。育ちゃん。とっても素敵なお話だけど、\nもうひとつ気をつけなくちゃいけないことがあるわ。", "zh": "呵呵……育。这番话真的很棒，\n但还有一点是你必须注意的哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_07_2004_010azu", "source_sha256": "0ac2e447116d1d195c9d65aca7dd6604c98af9e03e88b36e6cce2852cdcddf6f", "ja": "海美ちゃんは、育ちゃんのお姉さまになったのだから\n……『お姉さま』って呼ばなくちゃ。ね？", "zh": "海美已经成为育的小姐姐了，\n所以……必须叫她“姐姐大人”才行喔。对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_07_2005_030iku", "source_sha256": "089a3bd4ba57c1cdd0d4ea188b0ee479518a93555ea611b2ccf2cdd40e7922e9", "ja": "あ！　……そ、そっか。\nそれじゃあ、えっと……海美お姉さま……？", "zh": "啊！……这、这样啊。\n那，那个……海美姐姐大人……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_07_2006_029umi", "source_sha256": "2044b639693f73401b2b53633fd0eda2264e325ddc4fb81526db2df6458e8f28", "ja": "！！！　……お、お姉さまっていうのは、ちょっと……\nお、お姉ちゃんとかでも、良くってよ。", "zh": "！！！　……叫、叫姐姐大人的话，有点太……\n叫、叫姐姐什么的，也是可以的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_07_2007_010azu", "source_sha256": "ce9e9525db48528ee75ba5cd9f4e845a7cf1b91e8b1e433f637183af08894417", "ja": "あら、それはダメよ。\nちゃんと『お姉さま』でなくちゃ。", "zh": "哎呀，那可不行哦。\n必须得好好叫“姐姐大人”才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_07_2008_029umi", "source_sha256": "a733c78280e21aedfce9f19d0dfb8c2856773434f20776e9f982baa90865759a", "ja": "え？　ど、どうしてですか？", "zh": "诶？为、为什么啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_07_2009_010azu", "source_sha256": "7fa127c8408c8a9da45be1945937316ea4e17f88f3e95ab86d5dde3b151a818c", "ja": "育ちゃんに『お姉ちゃん』って\n呼ばれていいのは、私だけだもの。", "zh": "能让育叫“姐姐”的，\n只有我一个人就够了呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_07_2010_010azu", "source_sha256": "1c93ebb2ad6c31721d80ec662c63d41a53179d610eb36efef491ddb4332a7152", "ja": "だから海美ちゃんも、私のことは『あずさお姉ちゃん』\nって呼んでいいのよ？　小さいころみたいにね♪", "zh": "所以海美也可以叫我“梓姐姐”\n哦？就像小时候那样♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_07_2011_029umi", "source_sha256": "5ea689e54d6b179703be877f7ec25754d454839ac02c4936712fa80ea2497e00", "ja": "えーっ！？　……じ、じゃあ、その……\nあ、あずさお姉、ちゃん……。", "zh": "诶——！？……那、那……\n梓、梓姐姐……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_07_2012_010azu", "source_sha256": "18507c59cf25ec46fea6cc88e76d9f29ef838cb5e2bc6ead355c397e5e0282b4", "ja": "うふふ、うれしいわ。\nまるで昔に戻ったみたい……♪", "zh": "呵呵呵，我好高兴呀。\n感觉就像回到了从前一样……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_07_2013_029umi", "source_sha256": "9cd0bdbc44e771d0344a1af75d2c8b68571d698818108b63afcd2fbccdc6f0f0", "ja": "……ね、ねえ、育。あずさお姉ちゃんって、\nちょっと変わってるよね……？", "zh": "……那、那个，育。梓姐姐她，\n感觉有点特别呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_07_2014_030iku", "source_sha256": "1c12eab808992df9b6db845391ae9cccc5195f80ac84b2960a437d1bc340db92", "ja": "うん……。\nわたしもそう思う……。", "zh": "嗯……\n我也这么觉得……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_07_2015_010azu", "source_sha256": "fb0dd933e73831aa32882a632d99eba5492c4ef6c0116eed687c625eee5db8e7", "ja": "まあ、ふたりで内緒話？\nずるいわ、私も混ぜてくれなくちゃ……。", "zh": "哎呀，你们两个在说悄悄话吗？\n真狡猾，也得算我一个才行呀……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_07_2016_101kot", "source_sha256": "14bd8fc1d6dbe60709f428700199d2b790b82b39a41bf92d81a8bbcaf25fe7a3", "ja": "学び舎で気品を育み、庭園にて優美に歌う。ここは\n乙女たちが日々を謳歌する『聖ミリオン女学園』……", "zh": "在学堂中培养品格，于庭园里优雅歌唱。这里是少女们每日尽情享受青春的『圣百万女学园』……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
